<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Dragon Slayer\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_Slayer_9866f8.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord%20Trophy\"><img alt=\"Dragon Lord Trophy\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_Lord_Trophy_23028d.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Tower%20Shield\"><img alt=\"Tower Shield\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tower_Shield_ea3208.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Carlin Dragon Lair Upper\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"66\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Carlin_Dragon_Lair_Upper_59956f.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Carlin Dragon Lair Lower\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"81\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Carlin_Dragon_Lair_Lower_cf290f.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">9.80<br/>December 12, 2012<br/>Winter Update 2012</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Carlin Dragon Lair</b> is located at the bottom of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin%20Corym%20Cave\">Carlin Corym Cave</a>. The upper level consists of 3 separate caves, the left one is the only one with <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Hatchling\">Dragon Hatchlings</a>. The lower level is one long cave with a lot of <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragons</a> and 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lords</a>.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Hatchling\"><img alt=\"Dragon Hatchling\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_Hatchling_61f167.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Hatchling\">Dragon Hatchling</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">185</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">380</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">200 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">55 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">145 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Fire Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Damage_Icon_7ba5fe.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>)</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-55× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Ham\">Dragon Ham</a> (common)</li>\n<li>Dragon's Tail (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Health%20Potion\">Health Potion</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\"><img alt=\"Dragon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_24987b.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragon</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">700</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,000</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">430 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">120 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">310 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Fire Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Damage_Icon_7ba5fe.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>)</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-105× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Ham\">Dragon Ham</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Steel%20Shield\">Steel Shield</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crossbow\">Crossbow</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Dragon's Tail (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-10× <a href=\"#/wiki/Burst%20Arrow\">Burst Arrow</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Longsword\">Longsword</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Steel%20Helmet\">Steel Helmet</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Broadsword\">Broadsword</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Plate%20Legs\">Plate Legs</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Dragon%20Leather\">Green Dragon Leather</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wand%20of%20Inferno\">Wand of Inferno</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Health%20Potion\">Strong Health Potion</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Dragon%20Scale\">Green Dragon Scale</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Double%20Axe\">Double Axe</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Dragon Hammer (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Serpent%20Sword\">Serpent Sword</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Diamond\">Small Diamond</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Shield\">Dragon Shield</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Crystal\">Life Crystal</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li>Dragonbone Staff (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Trophy\">Dragon Trophy</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\"><img alt=\"Dragon Lord\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_Lord_c599c2.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lord</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">2,100</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,900</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">670 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">230 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">440 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Fire Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Damage_Icon_7ba5fe.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>)</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-245× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-5× <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Ham\">Dragon Ham</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Mushroom\">Green Mushroom</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Book%20%28Gemmed%29\">Book (Gemmed)</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-3× Royal Spear (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-7× <a href=\"#/wiki/Power%20Bolt\">Power Bolt</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Ring\">Energy Ring</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Sapphire\">Small Sapphire</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Golden%20Mug\">Golden Mug</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Dragon%20Scale\">Red Dragon Scale</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Dragon%20Leather\">Red Dragon Leather</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Health%20Potion\">Strong Health Potion</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Crystal\">Life Crystal</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Strange Helmet (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Sword\">Fire Sword</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Royal%20Helmet\">Royal Helmet</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Tower%20Shield\">Tower Shield</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Scale%20Mail\">Dragon Scale Mail</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord%20Trophy\">Dragon Lord Trophy</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li>Dragon Slayer (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Route\">Route</span></h2>\n<p>Go down a hole in the most southern part of the sewers of <a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a> <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32349,31836,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32349, 31836, 8)</a>, then follow the following maps.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"edf13531dd627e1144d09a78f2d6d48b\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Carlin_Dragon_Lair_1-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:131px; width:185px; top:27px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"131\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Carlin_Dragon_Lair_1_2b85ef.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Carlin Dragon Lair 1.png (924 bytes)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Carlin_Dragon_Lair_2-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:150px; top:0.5px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Carlin_Dragon_Lair_2_b0cbee.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Carlin Dragon Lair 2.png (3 KB)\" wi